# Instead of taking the tram in Russian: вместо того чтобы…
subtitle: "Вместо того чтобы, для того чтобы: say instead of doing and in order to in Russian, as Masha walks to work to save for the sea."
tags: ["russian","вместо того чтобы","для того чтобы","russian conjunctions","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/linking-words","vocabulary/money"]
thumb: "band \"Instead of taking the tram\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
